# DMS Backend

- SQL: always through `sql_guardrail.py` (sqlglot parse + allowlist). Parameterize queries.
- NL queries: `query_service.py` → judgment model → guard_and_execute. Never raw LLM SQL.
- Compliance: call `CortexOS/compliance/engine.py` — LLM extracts, rules decide pass/fail.
- Tiering: classification/suggestion/PII = T0/T1/T2 local only. No T3 in hot loops.
- New DMS tables: Postgres migrations + RLS policies. DuckDB for analytics warehouse only.

## API routes

Register in `CortexOS/api/dms_query.py`. Use `register_dms_routes(app)`.
